Z||000000||chris west||05-25-2000||12:25 PM||||To the Fiero enthusiast: <BR>Keth Huff [FIERO DOCK] is going out of business. He has made this dissuasion <BR>with difficulty and is now going on to other ventures, he is still going to keep his <BR>hand in the fiero's with dedication just not on a daily bases. Weat Coast Fiero's is <BR>going to pick up the work from Fiero Motor sports in Orange and move it to Marina <BR>del Rey. I hope we can service the fiero community as well as Fiero Motor sports <BR>has done. The new phone is 1 310 305 4111.<BR>Chris||||reg||1
Z||000001||stimpy||05-25-2000||07:50 PM||||THE MAN has arrived!!! Now the forum truly is all things Fiero! Welcome Chris, your name has been mentioned around here a lot, so your reputation preceeds you. I always recommend your expertise when it comes to 3.8 swaps as you corrected many of the oversights on my dad's ACE conversion. Of course, you did jinx me. When we came down to pick up his car right after you painted your 3.4 turbo- you offered to hook me up w/ a 3.8 and I stated (and I quote myself) "I'm not doing anything to this car until the engine grenades." 4 hours later I had a fist sized hole in the block from a weak oil pump. Still got a 3.8 for me?||||reg||1
